{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","噜噜"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名英勇的坦克，善于承担伤害和冲锋陷阵。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","噜噜，不会后退……"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Lumont won't retreat."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","噜噜要画一幅新画来纪念！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Lumont will paint a picture for this moment!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","向前，向前，冲啊——"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Forward charge!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","可以，回家了吗……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Can Lumont... go home now...?"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","噜噜只是，冲在了前头……"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Lumont will charge ahead!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","噜噜不怕冲锋，但噜噜更喜欢画画"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Heh, Lumont isn't scared of the front lines!"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","我，我画，我的画，什么。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","哦，没有坡，这里需要补一点颜色了，还有这里，哦。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","好多沙子，该洗澡了…"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇！心心念念的礼物，你太好了！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","谢谢……噜噜收到礼物已经很开心了。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这里画上花瓣……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","有点暗，看不清"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","噜噜想吃饼干！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","白色的，是雪吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","节日，快乐，礼物！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","可爱的，怪兽！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","焰火，真好看！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","噜噜身材高大，但画的画里面的东西都很小。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","噜噜生性害羞，不善言辞。如果你跟他问好，他只会以背影回应你。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","噜噜喜欢做手工。手那么大，手工那么小，真不知道他怎么做到的。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","噜噜生性善良，即使你说他的坏话，他也只会自己难过。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","噜噜头上的角也可以用来攻击，但是他不好意思和别人靠得太近。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","噜噜会去绿洲寻找植物，装饰在自己做的花瓶里。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","噜噜洗涂装的颜料桶时，会小心让废水不要污染草地。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","噜噜希望有朝一日，自己的设计能被世人认同。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","噜噜制造的武器很强，但伤害他人并不是他的本意，对他夸赞武器的威力会让他有些难过。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","“比起战士，他更适合当个匠人。”噜噜的家人曾经摇着头这么说。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","说到吃的话，沙漠里的旅人树果还不错……噜噜呢？有爱吃的食物吗？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411050.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 噜噜 & 漫漫"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","如果风暴要来，最好戴一条头巾。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411140.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","为什么，盯着噜噜？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415708.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","噜噜 & 戈丹"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","这里加一点红色……这里的地面上，再加上很多红色的花！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415017.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","噜噜 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","这里画上花瓣……"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415072.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","噜噜想吃饼干！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415073.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","白色的，是雪吗？"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415381.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","节日，快乐，礼物！"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415382.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","可爱的，怪兽！"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415553.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","焰火，真好看！"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415554.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","噜噜"]]}